# s79b y-br: c78y (s ideal, M real at t16) with U REAL from the bottom-right (sensor (3,-1) + note block (3,-2) + observer (2,-2), set by --vary), L0 ideal (observer (-2,-1) removed by --vary), R0 ideal.
